{"hymn":"S272","parent":"E339","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"¡Cuán firme cimiento para nuestra fe","subtitle":"La certeza y el gozo de la salvación—Un fundamento firme","syl":{"n1":"¡Cuán","n2":["fir","i"],"n3":["me","t"],"n4":["ci","i"],"n5":["mien","m"],"n6":["to","t"],"n7":["pa","i"],"n8":["ra","t"],"n10":["nues","i"],"n11":["tra","t"],"n12":"fe","n14":"Ha","n15":["pues","i"],"n16":["to‿el","t"],"n17":["Se","i"],"n18":["ñor","t"],"n20":"en","n21":"Su","n22":["Pa","i"],"n23":["la","m"],"n24":["bra","t"],"n25":"fiel!","n26":"¿Qué","n27":"más","n28":"Él","n29":["di","i"],"n30":["rá","t"],"n31":"que","n32":"lo","n33":"que","n35":"ya","n36":["ha","i"],"n37":["bló","t"],"n40":["A‿a","i"],"n41":["quel","t"],"n43":"que‿en","n44":["Je","i"],"n45":["sús","t"],"n46":"su","n47":["re","i"],"n48":["fu","m"],"n50":["gió","t"],"n51":["bus","i"],"n52":["có?","t"],"n54":["A‿a","i"],"n55":["quel","t"],"n57":"que‿en","n58":["Je","i"],"n59":["sús","t"],"n60":"su","n61":["re","i"],"n62":["fu","m"],"n63":["gió","t"],"n64":["bus","i"],"n65":["có?","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["\"No temas, no cedas, contigo estoy,","Pues Yo soy tu Dios y socorro te doy.","Yo te daré fuerzas y firme‿estarás;","Mi diestra potente te sustentará\"."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["\"Cuando‿aguas profundas te llame‿a cruzar,","Los ríos de pena no‿haré desbordar.","Contigo‿estaré y te bendeciré;","Ahí tus problemas santificaré\"."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["\"Cuando‿en prueba‿ardiente se halle tu‿andar,","Mi gracia‿abundante allí te‿hallará.","No daña la llama, mas éste‿es Mi plan:","Quemaré la‿escoria para‿oro ganar\"."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["\"Al envejecer, aún Mi pueblo verá","Mi‿amor soberano que no cesará;","Aun cuando de canas cubiertos estén,","Serán Mis corderos y los cargaré\"."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["El alma que‿en Cristo reposando‿esté,","Nunca‿a su‿enemigo se la dejaré;","Aún si la‿atacan las huestes del mal,","Yo nunca jamás la he de desertar."]}]}